171
00:13:35,743 --> 00:13:36,303
AK.

172
00:13:37,203 --> 00:13:38,783
O K'lar

173
00:13:38,783 --> 00:13:39,163
İngiliz.

174
00:13:42,363 --> 00:13:43,383
